Files adapted (see each file's own header for the original per-file notice):
  - vision/recognizer.py         — base ONNX recognizer + HuggingFace model download
  - vision/operators.py          — image preprocessing operators
  - vision/postprocess.py        — detection box decode/NMS postprocessing
  - vision/ocr.py                — OCR text detection + recognition
  - vision/layout_recognizer.py  — page layout analysis (multi-column, reading order)
  - vision/table_structure_recognizer.py — borderless/complex table structure recognition
  - nlp/rag_tokenizer.py         — Chinese/English tokenizer (used by table structure
                                    recognizer to help merge cell text)
  - res/huqie.txt                — Chinese word-frequency dictionary used by rag_tokenizer

Modifications:
  - Import paths rewired from `service.core.*` (original RAGFlow layout) to this
    project's `app.deepdoc.*` package layout.
  - Removed `init_in_out()` CLI helper and its `pdfplumber` dependency (RAGFlow's own
    CLI tooling); this project renders pages via PyMuPDF instead.
  - See individual PRs/commits for further adaptation details specific to rag-kb's
    Parser Gateway integration.
